<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 7.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanOcean TBN 52,000 hss NoPac/S.Korea 1-10/12 $14.85 10,000/6,500 or 7,250 Shoyang.</p>
<p>Despina 54,000 long tons hss USG/Japan 15-25/11 $24.50 w/o combo 11 days shinc Shoyang (amends).</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
